  "description": {
   "value": "<p>As an action, you can force all creatures within 30 feet of you to make a Wisdom saving throw against your Cursed Energy save DC. On a failure, they are frightened of you for 1 minute. A creature can repeat the save at the end of their turn. Once you use this feature, you cannot use it again until you finish a long rest.</p>",
